---
description: Astro and Tailwind presentation, with no parallel catalog.
globs: src/pages/**,src/components/**,src/layouts/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Tailwind with the tokens in `src/styles/global.css`. No loose hex. No direct fetch to `wixapis.com`. Wix data comes in through functions in `src/wix`, called from the frontmatter. A React island only when the shipped component requires it or the state belongs to the visitor.
